    "message": "Keep daily development within the fixed Side Panel byte budget\n\nParallel UI growth made the working tool-shell exceed 512 KiB. Load the existing Cloud view factory from the already audited fixed UI entry and pass the same visible RunHost and client.\n\nConstraint: Keep the 512 KiB gate, CSP, daily dist/development path and unique Host\nRejected: Increasing the budget or loading dynamic privileged code | would weaken established boundaries\nConfidence: high\nScope-risk: narrow\nDirective: This is compile-time UI placement only; dynamic tools still use the opaque sandbox\nTested: Clean-main SDK CI https://github.com/shopable-ai/opendesk-browser/actions/runs/38453502609; source syntax; current daily development compile\nNot-tested: New clean-commit bundle proof and complete native acceptance are recorded separately",
